# Nested's pinned carousel row (horizontal, leading header): prepends at the start and
# mid-list, overlapping responses, prepends landing under a drag and a fling, and appends at the end.
route Nested
latency 250,700
wait 2
mark start-prepend
press 296 80
wait 2
mark start-burst
repeat 3 press 296 80
wait 3
mark scroll-mid
repeat 3 pan 330 270 -260 0 300
wait 1.5
mark mid-prepend
press 296 80
wait 2
mark mid-burst
repeat 3 press 296 80
wait 3
mark drag-during-prepend
press 296 80
pan 300 270 -120 0 1500
wait 2
mark fling-during-prepend
press 296 80
pan 340 270 -300 0 120
wait 3
mark go-to-end
repeat 8 pan 370 270 -330 0 100
wait 1.5
mark append-at-end
repeat 2 press 333 80
wait 3
